{
  "name": "deps_decide",
  "description": "A person's decision on an update: monday (add to the next batch), own (its own pull request), not_yet, let_through (a risky release), take_now, ignore (version_range such as 19.x, patches or an exact version; reason; all_repos), drop or put_back (in an open pull request), stop_ignoring (id is an ignore's), ask (id is a pull request's; text). Settles the item in Today.",
